      "description": "GTM Advisor, Discovery Outcomes. 0 to 1 GTM Strategy: building go-to-market for an AI-powered GTM platform from scratch. Product Positioning Advisory: helping position \"human-like AI strategist\" for B2B marketing teams. Calibrated Product Launch Strategy: guiding AI-native GTM approach for market entry. Customer Acquisition Framework: designing acquisition strategy for an AI-driven lead nurturing solution. Market Positioning: positioning the platform as \"first GTM platform delivering qualified sales-ready leads on autopilot\"."
