    {
      "@type": "Role",
      "@id": "https://www.gtmexpert.com/#role-quantumstreet-advisor",
      "roleName": "Advisor, GTM, Growth and Strategy",
      "name": "Advisor, GTM, Growth and Strategy, QuantumStreet AI",
      "startDate": "2023-02",
      "description": "Advisor, GTM, Growth and Strategy, QuantumStreet AI. QuantumStreet AI is EquBot's institutional business, powering $7 billion in global assets; a Silicon Valley fintech applying AI to investment strategies; offerings Portfolio as a Service and SaaS. Led Complete Rebrand: from Equbot to QuantumStreet AI with Digitas Agency. Brand Architecture Development: created new brand positioning and messaging framework. 0 to 1 GTM Strategy: advisory for one of the world's first AI funds. $7B AUM Fund Marketing: GTM advisory for an AI-powered investment platform."
    },
    {
      "@type": "Role",
      "@id": "https://www.gtmexpert.com/#role-fieldassist-cmo",
      "roleName": "CMO",
      "name": "CMO, FieldAssist",
      "startDate": "2023-04",
      "endDate": "2024-09",
      "description": "CMO, FieldAssist. 2.25x growth in mid-market and enterprise qualified leads. +30% organic website traffic with zero paid activity. 2x organic social growth: LinkedIn followers from 10.5K to 23K+. 419 validated leads: built pipeline with 256 assigned leads (38 C/D/E + 28 B category accounts). 60 enterprise accounts in opportunity stage: 28 mid-market + 32 large company leads. FAi Launch GTM: led positioning, launch plan and demand engine for the FieldAssist AI product. DMS GTM Launch: executed a 3-phase go-to-market for the Distribution Management System. Africa GTM: concluded international GTM strategy for African markets. Big 4 Roundtables: initiated partnerships with PwC, EY and Deloitte for enterprise RTM discussions. Pathfinders Video Series: revitalized series featuring CPG founders; Atomberg episode hit 3.5K views (series record)."
    },
    {
      "@type": "Role",
      "@id": "https://www.gtmexpert.com/#role-locus-vp",
      "roleName": "VP Global Performance Marketing",
      "name": "VP Global Performance Marketing, Locus",
      "startDate": "2022-02",
      "endDate": "2022-10",
      "description": "VP Global Performance Marketing, Locus. $4.2M pipeline generated in H1 CY22. 79% SAO achievement: 108 sales accepted opportunities worldwide. 203% SEA region achievement: exceeded targets in Southeast Asia. $1.9M North America pipeline: 64% achievement in NA region. Managed team of 12 with $1.6M marketing budget. Built best-in-class ABM programs. Expanded marketing technology infrastructure. 99 priority keywords improved in Q2. Two Gartner mentions. Inbound SDR process streamlined with ICP activity-based lead scoring. Locus was acquired by IKEA (Ingka Group) in Oct 2025."
    },
